"No. Reporting works with read-only access. A change is proposed with what it touches, and applied only when you press Apply. There is no approve tool in the list the model can call, so it cannot be talked into applying anything. Destructive changes are flagged; anything over a guardrail is blocked until you look. <0>The doctrine page</0> links the file that enforces it."
